  "quest.64992D4C546E810C.quest_desc": [
    "&eProsperity Shards&r are the glittery backbone of Mystical Agriculture — infusion crystals, seed bases, gemstones, and half the \"grow your resources\" tech tree start here.",
    "",
    "This is the entry material for the Mystical Agriculture chapter. Check JEI for &fmysticalagriculture:prosperity_shard&r (often from prosperity ore / essence crafting on this pack) and stockpile early.",
    "",
    "From here: prosperity seed base → resource seeds, infusion crystals, farmland tiers, and the whole crop-to-ingot pipeline — plus Agradditions extras and Mystical Automation machines.",
    "",
    "&aCompleting this quest unlocks three minable pools for your team: Mystical Agriculture, Mystical Agradditions, and Mystical Automation.&r",
  ],
